{"id":"a317f5836d8736b5","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-sound-implies-consistent.md","title":"Sound Implies Consistent","display":"thm-sound-implies-consistent — Sound Implies Consistent","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-sound-implies-consistent","aliases":["92-thm-sound-implies-consistent"],"display":"thm-sound-implies-consistent — Sound Implies Consistent","depends_on":["[[92-df-sound-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-g-system]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-sound-implies-consistent"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-sound-implies-consistent</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sound-implies-consistent — Sound Implies Consistent"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound},\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound},\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> (soundness and consistency predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sound\\text{-}implies\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sound\\text{-}implies\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>可靠 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>一致 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li>可靠系统只证明真句子，因此不可能证明矛盾</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(G \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span>且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\vdash \\neg\\varphi\">\\(G \\vdash \\neg\\varphi\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>都真，矛盾</li>\n<li>可靠性比一致性更强</li>\n<li>反之不成立：存在一致但不可靠的系统</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ : $G$可靠 (see [[92-df-sound-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ : $G$一致 (see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound},\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sound\\text{-}implies\\text{-}consistent} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G \\vdash \\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-323","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-sound-implies-consistent]]"}],"outgoing":["d76d3a84b374975c","c7befd96bd551ade","e0eabee5d77258a7"]}